# Tier 3: constant potential (&GCE UPDATE_SCHEME CAPACITANCE) on a 3-layer Al(111) 2x2 slab.
# fcc Al a = 4.0495 A; (111) in-plane 2.86345 A, d(111) = 2.3379 A. 2x2 cell (A = 5.7269 A,
# B at 60 deg), 3 layers ABC-stacked, 12 atoms, c = 20 A, slab at z = 7.662 / 10.000 / 12.338,
# about 15 A of implicit electrolyte around it.
# Gamma only, so the cell is 2x2 rather than 1x1: a 1x1 at Gamma has too few states at E_F for
# the Fermi-Dirac smearing, and the secant capacitance then chases numerical noise.
# The slab physics is not the point. The test pins (i) that the outer loop runs and prints its
# "GCE| outer update" lines and (ii) that the final energy is reproducible.
# &GCE needs &SMEAR METHOD FERMI_DIRAC and ADDED_MOS. There is no &PLANAR_COUNTER_CHARGE: the
# electrolyte is the counter charge, and adding a planar one would count it twice.
# UPDATE_EVERY SCF_CYCLE makes each update an outer iteration on a converged density;
# MAX_OUTER_UPDATES 5 caps it. CONVERGENCE_CHECK is left off on purpose: a slab this small can
# miss SCF convergence on a badly sampled Fermi level, which is not a build regression.
# TARGET_POTENTIAL [eV] 0.5 with PHI_SHE [eV] 4.43 -> target work function 4.93 eV.
&GLOBAL
  PRINT_LEVEL medium
  PROJECT Al111_gce_cap_lpb
  RUN_TYPE energy
&END GLOBAL
&FORCE_EVAL
  METHOD Quickstep
  &DFT
    BASIS_SET_FILE_NAME BASIS_MOLOPT
    POTENTIAL_FILE_NAME GTH_POTENTIALS
    CHARGE 0
    &MGRID
      CUTOFF 300
      REL_CUTOFF 40
      NGRIDS 4
    &END MGRID
    &POISSON
      PERIODIC XYZ
      POISSON_SOLVER PERIODIC
    &END POISSON
    &QS
      EPS_DEFAULT 1.0E-10
      EXTRAPOLATION ASPC
    &END QS
    &PRINT
      &SCCS on
        &EACH
          QS_SCF 0
        &END EACH
      &END SCCS
    &END PRINT
    &SCCS on
      ALPHA [N*m^-1] 0.0
      BETA [kbar] 0.0
      GAMMA [mN/m] 0.0
      DELTA_RHO 2.0E-5
      DERIVATIVE_METHOD fft
      DIELECTRIC_CONSTANT 78.36
      EPS_SCCS 1.0E-6
      EPS_SCF 0.5
      MAX_ITER 200
      METHOD ISODENSITY
      MIXING 0.6
      SOLVER NEWTON_CG
      SOLVER_TOLERANCE 1.0E-9
      SOLVER_MAX_ITER 50
      DEBYE_LENGTH [angstrom] 3.04
      &ISODENSITY
        RHO_CAVITY [angstrom^-3] 0.0025
        SWITCH_WIDTH 0.6
      &END ISODENSITY
    &END SCCS
    &SCF
      EPS_SCF 1.0E-6
      MAX_SCF 150
      SCF_GUESS atomic
      ADDED_MOS 20
      &DIAGONALIZATION on
        ALGORITHM STANDARD
      &END DIAGONALIZATION
      &SMEAR on
        METHOD FERMI_DIRAC
        ELECTRONIC_TEMPERATURE [K] 300
      &END SMEAR
      &MIXING
        METHOD BROYDEN_MIXING
        ALPHA 0.2
        NBROYDEN 8
      &END MIXING
      &GCE on
        UPDATE_SCHEME CAPACITANCE
        UPDATE_EVERY SCF_CYCLE
        TARGET_POTENTIAL [eV] 0.5
        PHI_SHE [eV] 4.43
        FERMI_TOL [eV] 0.01
        MAX_OUTER_UPDATES 5
      &END GCE
      &PRINT
        &RESTART off
        &END RESTART
      &END PRINT
    &END SCF
    &XC
      &XC_FUNCTIONAL PBE
      &END XC_FUNCTIONAL
    &END XC
  &END DFT
  &SUBSYS
    &CELL
      A      5.726900    0.000000    0.000000
      B      2.863450    4.959638    0.000000
      C      0.000000    0.000000   20.000000
      PERIODIC XYZ
    &END CELL
    &COORD
      Al        0.000000    0.000000    7.662000
      Al        2.863450    0.000000    7.662000
      Al        1.431725    2.479820    7.662000
      Al        4.295175    2.479820    7.662000
      Al        1.431725    0.826607   10.000000
      Al        4.295175    0.826607   10.000000
      Al        2.863450    3.306427   10.000000
      Al        5.726900    3.306427   10.000000
      Al        2.863450    1.653213   12.338000
      Al        5.726900    1.653213   12.338000
      Al        4.295175    4.133033   12.338000
      Al        7.158625    4.133033   12.338000
    &END COORD
    &KIND Al
      BASIS_SET DZVP-MOLOPT-SR-GTH
      POTENTIAL GTH-PBE-q3
    &END KIND
  &END SUBSYS
&END FORCE_EVAL
